Package: linuxscp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Description: graphical and console file transfer client
 LinSCP is a native open-source file transfer client inspired by WinSCP,
 providing both an interactive command-line interface and a dual-pane
 Commander graphical client
 (linuxscp-gui).
 .
 Provides native SFTP, curl-backed transfers, basic transfer resume and
 recursive synchronization, public-key authentication, and a subset of
 WinSCP scripting. Protocol support depends on the backend; WebDAV and
 Amazon S3 support are incomplete. Full WinSCP feature parity is not provided.
